1
00:00:07,550 --> 00:00:12,149
Every New Year’s Eve, the monster Nian came down from the mountains.

2
00:00:13,550 --> 00:00:16,850
One by one, the village put out its lights.

3
00:00:19,550 --> 00:00:24,749
But Nian fears three things: the color red, bright light, and loud noise.

4
00:00:35,150 --> 00:00:38,134
Crackle, bang! And away ran Nian.

5
00:00:38,550 --> 00:00:43,646
That is why, every New Year, we still paste red paper on our windows.
